//
// Cloudflare Workers & Pages builds previews of the game from this repository (the Worker is called
// last-combustion). The game is a static site, so the Worker only serves the built files in `dist`.
// The release site, lc.nexxusdrako.au, is the same Worker built from `main`; its domain is attached in the
// dashboard, so there is no `routes` entry here.
//
// The Worker's build settings in the Cloudflare dashboard are:
//   - build command:  pnpm run build   (Cloudflare finds pnpm and installs the dependencies itself)
//   - deploy command: npx wrangler deploy for `main` (production), npx wrangler preview for other branches
// `wrangler preview` needs the (empty) `previews` block below. The telemetry keys
// (VITE_GTAG_ID, VITE_GA_GAME_KEY, VITE_GA_SECRET_KEY) go on the Worker only when the release site moves
// here: vite.telemetry.ts drops them from every Cloudflare build that is not of `main`.
{
  "$schema": "node_modules/wrangler/config-schema.json",
  "name": "last-combustion",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-11-01",
  "assets": {
    "directory": "./dist",
    "not_found_handling": "single-page-application"
  },
  "previews": {}
}
